# Cloudflare Pages response headers
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# HTML is deliberately NOT listed here. Cloudflare Pages already serves pages
# with "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate", which is exactly what we want: a
# deploy is visible immediately. Pages are also served at extensionless URLs
# (/tratamientos/diatermia), so a /*.html rule would never match them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- security
# The site answered on http:// with a 200 and no redirect, so anything a
# patient typed into the contact form could be read in transit. Cloudflare's
# "Always Use HTTPS" closes that door; these headers cover what a response can
# do on its own.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security starts at one week on purpose. Browsers take it
# seriously: once they have seen it they will refuse http:// for this domain
# for the whole period, and if a certificate ever fails they cannot be talked
# out of it. A week is long enough to be worth having and short enough to
# recover from. Raise it to 31536000 after a few uneventful weeks, and only
# add includeSubDomains once every subdomain is known to serve HTTPS.
# Do not add preload: getting back off that list takes months.
#
# There is no Content-Security-Policy here, deliberately. The pages carry 3483
# inline style attributes, 183 inline scripts and 18 style blocks, so any
# policy that did not break the site would need unsafe-inline for both scripts
# and styles - which is most of what a CSP is for. A CSP is worth adding after
# that inline code is moved out, not before, because a permissive one mostly
# buys the feeling of being protected.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=604800
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- caching
# Stylesheets are cache-busted with ?v=N in every <link>.
# Bump that number whenever style.css or responsive.css changes.
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

# Theme fonts never change.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Slider assets ship with the purchased template and are not edited.
/revolution/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

# Images are occasionally replaced in place, so keep the window short.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# JavaScript carries no version query yet, so it has to revalidate.
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
